          %h2#examples Examples
          %h3#SnatihTheorem Snaith’s theorem and the units of K-theory and complex cobordism
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Snaith%27s+theorem"} Snaith's theorem
            asserts that
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K-theory+spectrum"} K-theory spectrum
                for
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+K-theory"} complex K-theory
